    <category>
        <pattern>* A *</pattern>
        <template><think><set name="dialogue_act">setQuestion</set></think><think><set name="elemento1">none</set></think><think><set name="elemento2">none</set></think><think><set name="insieme">A</set></think><think><set name="topic">insieme</set></think>Nel primo cerchio (nel dominio) ci sono 6 elementi: Luca, Arianna, Loredana, Michele, Pierpaolo, Davide.<image>insiemi/esempio7.svg</image><svgElement style-name="fill" style-value="#04ed00">insieme-dominio</svgElement></template>
